# The Monster Race Track trip back (MonsterRaceTrack): a memo saved before the character entered
# the world, by a town gatekeeper's trip (Bilia, 31964), sends the character through the race
# manager (30995, a DerbyTrackManagerNpc) back to that gatekeeper's town, and the memo is deleted
# (onTalk). Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/monster_race_track_return.golden
character Gambler 20
memo MonsterRaceTrack_Npc 31964
script script.teleport.MonsterRaceTrack
page default/30995.htm
npc manager 30995 DerbyTrackManagerNpc 10 0 0

action manager
action manager
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=manager item=0 page=default/30995.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{manager}_Quest MonsterRaceTrack
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S TeleportToLocation obj=player loc=87386,-143246,-1293 fast=0
  S DeleteObject obj=manager
  S ActionFailed
  M unset MonsterRaceTrack_Npc
